+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+with `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy` and `test` operations. It returns a new value, leaving
+the input document unchanged, and throws if the patch is malformed or an operation fails. Array `add`
+accepts `-` to append; other array indices use canonical non-negative decimal notation.
